{title: Pari Hu Main}
{artist: Sunita Rao}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]aai main to [A]aai nazaron ke [E]anjane ek jahan se
[E]lai main to [A]lai baharon ke [E]afsane bhi wahan se
[Bm]na na mujhe chhuna [A]na duur hi rahna
[E]pari hoon main
[E]pari hoon main
[Bm]mujhe [A]na chhooona
[E]pari hoon main
[Am7]phul-o mein jo [D]nuur hai mera [E]hi suruur hai oho
[Am7]ankho mein [D]guruur hai khwabo [E]ka kusur hai
[Am7]thoda sa karaar [D]hai thoda sa [E]khumaar hai oho
[Am7]kiska intezaar [D]hai kaisa [E]intezaar hai
[A]koi to [E]aisa ho [A]sanso ko [E]meri mehka jaye
